                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a783b63-a0ef-3430-98bb-e3bda20dd3bc",
                        "entry_id": "3355b05b-a1d0-3463-8c39-be7d4cbac2d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To sexually assault (someone)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87139fb9-d3e7-4e3f-9c3a-10c276c67d15",
                                "sense_id": "4a783b63-a0ef-3430-98bb-e3bda20dd3bc",
                                "text": "This time CPS did really investigate a lot more thoroughly, and the CPS worker said that she believes Allison was SA'ed by her dad, but that the role of CPS is to *remove children from abusive homes* and since Allison does not live in the abusive home, the duty falls to me to go thru the family court system to get no-visitation orders in place."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6321fb7-89df-4467-b323-5c9846a229c2",
                                "sense_id": "4a783b63-a0ef-3430-98bb-e3bda20dd3bc",
                                "text": "Remind me of that night and while I threw away the clothes I was SA'd in,, the clothes I wore to be around him make me feel gross too and"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2250fdf-b54e-48a4-8a5c-40b886765bf3",
                                "sense_id": "4a783b63-a0ef-3430-98bb-e3bda20dd3bc",
                                "text": "I just saw that! She doesn’t know anything! She’s regurgitating bull for a video to make money! And her subs won’t question it!! They apparently like middle aged woman attacking a little girl who was SA’d! Absolutely vile and disgusting"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d38a5b2a-558f-42b9-99e7-4225d082e632",
                                "sense_id": "4a783b63-a0ef-3430-98bb-e3bda20dd3bc",
                                "text": "Unfortunately, the dark side of the music industry isn’t new. In 1989, Alanis Morissette was 15 years old when she was SA’d by several men during the start of her music career. In 1992-93, R. Kelly SA’d Aaliyah when she was 13 or 14 years old. In 2005, Lady Gaga was SA’d by a record producer when she was 19 years old. This shouldn’t be happening, but somehow a lot of shady behavior is often swept under the rug."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e85e6f5d-8036-46e1-a1aa-fc87f034bc4b",
                                "sense_id": "4a783b63-a0ef-3430-98bb-e3bda20dd3bc",
                                "text": "These same type of men will make disgusting “jokes” about SA’ing women they politically disagree with, a big target of theirs will be teenage girls. When said girls tell them to rightfully get lost out come the “jokes” about wanting to SA them or hoping the girls get SA’ed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
